<mjml lang="en-AU">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Your insulation install is booked – Wednesday 11 November at 7:30am</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Consent signed and deposit received. Here's what to do before the day.</mj-preview>
    <mj-include path="./partials/head.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-wrapper css-class="card">
      <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="h1" css-class="email-heading">Your install is booked, Helen</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Consent signed and deposit received &#10003; Your day is locked in.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel">
          <mj-text mj-class="eyebrow center" padding="18px 12px 6px">Your install</mj-text>
          <mj-text mj-class="center" font-family="Outfit, Figtree, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="24px" line-height="30px" font-weight="800" padding="0 12px 2px">Wednesday 11 November</mj-text>
          <mj-text mj-class="center" font-weight="700" padding="0 12px 8px">Arriving 7:30am</mj-text>
          <mj-text mj-class="small center" padding="0 16px 18px">824 High Street Road, Glen Waverley<br />Installer: Sample Insulation Co · 0400 000 000</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-card">
          <mj-table padding="8px 18px 0">
            <tr><td style="padding:10px 0;">Deposit paid</td><td align="right" style="padding:10px 0 10px 12px;white-space:nowrap;">$185.10</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid #E4E9F5;"><strong>Balance due on install day</strong></td><td align="right" style="padding:10px 0 10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #E4E9F5;white-space:nowrap;"><strong>$1,665.90</strong></td></tr>
          </mj-table>
          <mj-text mj-class="small" padding="4px 18px 16px">Receipt attached. Want to pay the balance now? <a href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST?pay=full" style="color:#3C51C4;font-weight:700;">Pay in full</a></mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-amber">
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" padding="18px 18px 6px">⚡ Your power will be off</mj-text>
          <mj-text padding="0 18px 16px">For safety, the power is off while the installer works in your ceiling. Charge phones and laptops first. Plan around the fridge, medical equipment and anyone working from home.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel-card">
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" padding="18px 18px 10px">On the day</mj-text>
          <mj-table padding="0 18px 6px">
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;">An adult (18+) at home to let the installer in and sign off at the end</td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;">Clear the area under the ceiling hatch and a path to it</td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;">Move cars if you can, so the van can park close</td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;">Keep pets away from the work area</td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="tick">&#10003;</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;">Old insulation is being removed, so expect some dust. Close internal doors and cover anything near the hatch.</td></tr>
          </mj-table>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text padding="16px 12px 14px">The installer takes before and after photos (the rebate needs them), lays your insulation and tidies up. Most homes take a few hours.</mj-text>
          <mj-button href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST">See my job</mj-button>
          <mj-text mj-class="small" padding="0 12px">Need to change the day? Use Change day on your job page. Questions? Just reply to this email.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-include path="./partials/footer-trade.mjml" />
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
